      <div class="story">
        <p class="lead">I work across quantum computing, data science and production software, turning complex ideas into systems people can study, test and use.</p>
        <p>My work includes quantum circuit analysis, superconducting qubit design, quantum natural language processing, scientific machine learning, secure optical communication and research in astronomy. ZX calculus is one part of a much broader interest in practical and understandable scientific computing.</p>
        <p>Through the MS in Data Science and Management at IIT Indore and IIM Indore, I am strengthening my foundations in statistics, machine learning, analytics and management decision making. This complements three years at Citi, where I built and governed regulated data ingestion workflows and learned how reliable systems operate at enterprise scale.</p>
